{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/585c71d313108cef7493b7104a7f6494.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/585c71d313108cef7493b7104a7f6494.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/585c71d313108cef7493b7104a7f6494.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Bleaklight Falls Demo, you will experience an abridged version of the first Act of Meelu's story in his fight for survival against the encroaching Dreadblight. The Demo includes 2+ hours of content until its conclusion with the first major boss battle, and remains playable after its conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend The Village!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials in the forest and mines during the day to build a wide selection of Offensive, Defensive, and Utility towers to prevent monsters from reaching the Bleaklight. Each tower can be upgraded to improve its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The towers are built on a grid system, allowing you creative freedom to funnel the monsters as they invade the village. Build your fortifications wisely, for the monsters will tear through anything that blocks their path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/f11d26a484c3ff20598cd170a6b03158.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/f11d26a484c3ff20598cd170a6b03158.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/f11d26a484c3ff20598cd170a6b03158.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up Meelu by spending Mastery Points in four trees - Weapon Mastery, Skill Mastery, Body Mastery, and Mind Mastery. Unlock nodes in these trees to gain powerful upgrades, additional skills, and features that encourage a variety of playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meelu can use many different weapons - Swords, Bows, Shields, Fists, and more to come. Each weapon has a unique Weapon Ability tree that levels up as you fight with the associated weapon. As you grow stronger, you'll unlock powers to mix and match abilities from different weapons to create unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/bf4993e8d8761e6bc7fc3063fdac4b0d.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/bf4993e8d8761e6bc7fc3063fdac4b0d.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/bf4993e8d8761e6bc7fc3063fdac4b0d.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Village Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bleaklight Falls is full of villagers with tales to tell.  Use the villagers' skills to craft, upgrade, and alter your gear, and to build powerful defensive structures. Grow your friendship with the villagers through branching dialogue options, questlines, and gifts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/158be9cee9ba280fd9795ac6cb195767.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/158be9cee9ba280fd9795ac6cb195767.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/158be9cee9ba280fd9795ac6cb195767.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARPG-Style Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ideal build by collecting loot from enemies, crafting and upgrading gear, and altering their stats to your liking. Find unique items with special effects that change your abilities and unlock powerful build options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/d875523ea7838fd5d4715545f4bb6050.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/d875523ea7838fd5d4715545f4bb6050.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/d875523ea7838fd5d4715545f4bb6050.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village and surrounding forest hold many secrets and treasures to uncover. Use Meelu's Jump ability to hop on top of roofs, around waterfalls, and up cliffs. Listen for chimes that grow louder as you approach to find secrets. Find landmarks in the forest that signify special quests and areas of interest for the villagers. Collect consumables that permanently boost your power, unlock recipes and tower schematics, add dyes to customize Meelu, and find gifts that build friendship with your fellow villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954420?t=1756128023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/1044e68eecbe3094743581709492288db4d729d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756128023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/bd7a10e00530f5c64f00b2898d972aed315af14c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756128023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/bd7a10e00530f5c64f00b2898d972aed315af14c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756128023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/585c71d313108cef7493b7104a7f6494.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/585c71d313108cef7493b7104a7f6494.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/585c71d313108cef7493b7104a7f6494.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Bleaklight Falls Demo, you will experience an abridged version of the first Act of Meelu's story in his fight for survival against the encroaching Dreadblight. The Demo includes 2+ hours of content until its conclusion with the first major boss battle, and remains playable after its conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend The Village!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials in the forest and mines during the day to build a wide selection of Offensive, Defensive, and Utility towers to prevent monsters from reaching the Bleaklight. Each tower can be upgraded to improve its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The towers are built on a grid system, allowing you creative freedom to funnel the monsters as they invade the village. Build your fortifications wisely, for the monsters will tear through anything that blocks their path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/f11d26a484c3ff20598cd170a6b03158.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/f11d26a484c3ff20598cd170a6b03158.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/f11d26a484c3ff20598cd170a6b03158.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up Meelu by spending Mastery Points in four trees - Weapon Mastery, Skill Mastery, Body Mastery, and Mind Mastery. Unlock nodes in these trees to gain powerful upgrades, additional skills, and features that encourage a variety of playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meelu can use many different weapons - Swords, Bows, Shields, Fists, and more to come. Each weapon has a unique Weapon Ability tree that levels up as you fight with the associated weapon. As you grow stronger, you'll unlock powers to mix and match abilities from different weapons to create unique builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/bf4993e8d8761e6bc7fc3063fdac4b0d.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/bf4993e8d8761e6bc7fc3063fdac4b0d.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/bf4993e8d8761e6bc7fc3063fdac4b0d.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Village Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bleaklight Falls is full of villagers with tales to tell.  Use the villagers' skills to craft, upgrade, and alter your gear, and to build powerful defensive structures. Grow your friendship with the villagers through branching dialogue options, questlines, and gifts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/158be9cee9ba280fd9795ac6cb195767.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/158be9cee9ba280fd9795ac6cb195767.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/158be9cee9ba280fd9795ac6cb195767.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARPG-Style Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ideal build by collecting loot from enemies, crafting and upgrading gear, and altering their stats to your liking. Find unique items with special effects that change your abilities and unlock powerful build options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/d875523ea7838fd5d4715545f4bb6050.poster.avif?t=1756128023\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/d875523ea7838fd5d4715545f4bb6050.webm?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/extras/d875523ea7838fd5d4715545f4bb6050.mp4?t=1756128023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village and surrounding forest hold many secrets and treasures to uncover. Use Meelu's Jump ability to hop on top of roofs, around waterfalls, and up cliffs. Listen for chimes that grow louder as you approach to find secrets. Find landmarks in the forest that signify special quests and areas of interest for the villagers. Collect consumables that permanently boost your power, unlock recipes and tower schematics, add dyes to customize Meelu, and find gifts that build friendship with your fellow villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Patticus"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2820610","name":"Bleaklight Falls"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954420/a93d45e65ae75c5a88f77718f48e449a4faffa95/header.jpg?t=1756128023","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_require